{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-11-18 12:26:00', 'title': 'BROADRIDGE DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.64 PER SHARE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC.\xa0(NYSE:BR) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.64 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 5, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 15, 2021.'}